{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-001", "rule_id": "heidenhain-connection", "rule_type": "connection", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": ["LSV2Open", "LSV2OpenEx", "LSV2Login", "LSV2ReceivePara"], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "LSV-2 使用 TCP 19000；先 LSV2Open/LSV2OpenEx，再按权限登录，最后 LSV2ReceivePara 初始化库参数。TNC640 默认地址由界面配置，安全探针必须 safe_mode=True。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-002", "rule_id": "heidenhain-permissions", "rule_type": "permissions", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": ["LSV2Login"], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "权限按官方 LSV-2 访问级别区分：FILETRANSFER、DNC、PLCDEBUG、DATA、INSPECT、SCOPE。权限不足、选件缺失或型号不适用时记录失败原因，不计入成功覆盖。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-003", "rule_id": "heidenhain-read_only", "rule_type": "read_only", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": [], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "知识库优先使用 LSV2Receive*、LSV2Get*、LSV2Has*、LSV2Is* 等读取函数。只读采集不得发送按键、删除文件、写机床常量或改变控制器状态。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-004", "rule_id": "heidenhain-write_control", "rule_type": "write_control", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": [], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "LSV2Set*、LSV2Write*、LSV2Transmit*、LSV2Delete*、LSV2Key*、LSV2Control* 和远程控制函数标为高风险；未经明确授权不进入只读采集目标。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-005", "rule_id": "heidenhain-runtime_mapping", "rule_type": "runtime_mapping", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": ["LSV2ReceiveVersions", "LSV2ReceivePara", "LSV2ReceiveDirInfo", "LSV2ReceiveDir", "LSV2ReceiveDrives", "LSV2ReceiveFileInfo", "LSV2GetFileList", "LSV2ReceiveAxesData", "LSV2ReceiveTime", "LSV2ReceiveScreenDump", "LSV2ReceiveRunInfo", "LSV2ReceiveDncInfo", "LSV2ReceiveMachineConstant", "LSV2ReceiveScopeData", "LSV2ReceiveDataEntryInfo", "LSV2ReceiveMem"], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "pyLSV2 只是运行适配层；例如 versions 映射 LSV2ReceiveVersions、directory_info 映射 LSV2ReceiveDirInfo。规划和检索主键必须使用官方 LSV2 函数名。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-006", "rule_id": "heidenhain-tnc640", "rule_type": "tnc640", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": [], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "TNC640 的适用性由真实设备结果和官方说明共同决定。iTNC530 专用实时读取接口不能因为 Python 包存在就算作 TNC640 可用。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-007", "rule_id": "heidenhain-official_compatibility", "rule_type": "official_compatibility", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": [], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "官方 lsv2_all.h 明确说明：LSV2 在 iTNC530 上是 fully supported；TNC620/TNC640 等 NCK-based controls 只支持 LSV2 的 subset。官方没有提供 201 个函数逐项 TNC640 全量兼容表，因此未明确标注的函数必须按软件版本、选件、权限和真实调用结果确认。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-008", "rule_id": "heidenhain-tnc640_collection_policy", "rule_type": "tnc640_collection_policy", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": [], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "当前采集策略按用户要求将 201 个官方函数中的 199 个纳入 TNC640 采集目标；排除 2 个明确的 iTNC530 专用函数。纳入目标表示允许进入计划，真实成功、权限错误、选件缺失和控制器不支持必须分别记录。"}
{"chunk_id": "heidenhain-rule-009", "rule_id": "heidenhain-coverage", "rule_type": "coverage", "scenario": "heidenhain_lsv2", "protocol": "lsv2", "controller": "TNC640", "applies_to": [], "source_type": "rule", "rule_text": "只有真实成功调用并写入结构化 API 日志的函数才计入覆盖；连接成功、目录为空、权限错误和计划名称不能代替目标函数流量。"}
